 in the oven and set your timer for 20 minutes.\\\\n\\\\n\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"how to do chicken legs in a DC convection oven\\\"}\", \"answer\": \"Based on the provided passages, here are the steps to cook chicken legs in a DC convection oven:\\n\\n1. Combine seasonings and oil in a large glass baking dish, add the chicken legs and coat with the spice mixture. Cover and refrigerate overnight or for a few hours. (Passage 1)\\n2. Pre-heat the oven to Convection Roast or Convection Bake at 350 degrees. Place the chicken legs on a rimmed baking sheet and place it in the oven on rack position 2. Cook for 20 minutes, turn the pieces, brush with BBQ sauce and cook for another 15 minutes. (Passage 1)\\n3. Pre-heat the oven to Convection Roast at 400 degrees. Meanwhile, cover a pan with foil and spray with a thin layer of canola spray. Place the chicken legs on the foil and set your timer for 20 minutes. When ready, reduce the heat to 325 degrees and set the timer for 10 minutes. (Passage 3)\\n\\nTherefore, to cook chicken legs in a DC convection oven, you can use any of the methods described in Passages 1 and 3. The cooking time may vary depending on the temperature used, but generally, it takes around 20-30 minutes to cook chicken legs in a convection oven.\", \"source_segments\": [{\"index\": 0, \"byte_start\": 0, \"byte_end\": 133}, {\"index\": 1, \"byte_start\": 133, \"byte_end\": 185}, {\"index\": 2, \"byte_start\": 185, \"byte_end\": 1111}, {\"index\": 3, \"byte_start\": 1111, \"byte_end\": 1190}, {\"index\": 4, \"byte_start\": 1190, \"byte_end\": 1271}, {\"index\": 5, \"byte_start\": 1271, \"byte_end\": 1422}, {\"index\": 6, \"byte_start\": 1422, \"byte_end\": 1581}, {\"index\": 7, \"byte_start\": 1581, \"byte_end\": 1717}], \"answer_sentence_indices\": [0], \"answer_offsets\": [{\"index\": 0, \"byte_start\": 0, \"byte_end\": 212}]}"}], "grammar": "root ::= r0\nr0 ::= \"0|\" relation \"|\" probability \"|\" refs\nrelation ::= \"E\" | \"C\" | \"B\"\nprobability :