 a pool game. I work at a restaurant and we could NEVER tell people to leave before closing like that. I understand it is a bar in IV, but we should have been able to have at least 10 more minutes to enjoy our time there. We were not being disruptive or rude. I get wanting to close and go home but your job is to close at 12, not kick people out early for convenience. Unprofessional.\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"answer\": \"Dublin's Sports Grill in Isla Vista, CA is a nightlife spot that offers food, drinks, and sports games on TV. According to customer reviews, the atmosphere is casual and not particularly trendy or upscale. While the menu includes a variety of pub-style fare, the service has been described as subpar by some patrons. One reviewer noted that the bartender seemed uninterested in serving customers, and another reported being yelled at to leave 20 minutes before closing time. The venue does not offer reservations, outdoor seating, or WiFi, and is known for having a DJ spinning music on weekends. Based on the provided data, Dublin's Sports Grill seems to be a no-frills hangout popular among locals, but its service may be inconsistent.\", \"source_segments\": [{\"index\": 0, \"byte_start\": 0, \"byte_end\": 831}, {\"index\": 1, \"byte_start\": 831, \"byte_end\": 879}, {\"index\": 2, \"byte_start\": 879, \"byte_end\": 1025}, {\"index\": 3, \"byte_start\": 1025, \"byte_end\": 1287}, {\"index\": 4, \"byte_start\": 1287, \"byte_end\": 1330}, {\"index\": 5, \"byte_start\": 1330, \"byte_end\": 1419}, {\"index\": 6, \"byte_start\": 1419, \"byte_end\": 1538}, {\"index\": 7, \"byte_start\": 1538, \"byte_end\": 1576}, {\"index\": 8, \"byte_start\": 1576, \"byte_end\": 1686}, {\"index\": 9, \"byte_start\": 1686, \"byte_end\": 1718}], \"answer_sentence_indices\": [0], \"answer_offsets\": [{\"index\": 0, \"byte_start\": 0, \"byte_end\": 110}]}"}], "grammar": "root ::= r0\nr0 ::= \"0|\" relation \"|\" probability \"|\" refs\nrelation ::= \"E\" | \"C\" | \"B\"\n